# ── Local developer tooling ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Verification helpers that run against a working copy only. Nothing here is
# imported by the application, and docker-compose bind-mounts this checkout
# over /app inside the container ("volumes: .:/app"), so anything committed
# here also lands on the production filesystem - which is the reason these are
# ignored rather than merely unused.
/_heads.py
/_drift.py
/scripts/
.claude/
/_fix_balance_due.py